WEBVTT

00:01:29.418 --> 00:01:32.463
Only for long enough to consolidate
his own power.

00:01:32.797 --> 00:01:35.550
Then he went to battle against
his brother-in-law—

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:37.635
supposedly his closest ally.

00:01:37.635 --> 00:01:40.555
He was assassinated,
and Timur seized power!

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.598
They may have been friends,

00:01:42.598 --> 00:01:45.685
but he was a corrupt man 
who alienated a lot of people.

00:01:45.685 --> 00:01:47.728
Timur was right to oust him.

00:01:48.104 --> 00:01:51.732
Afterward, he managed to reunite 
most of the khanate’s territories

00:01:51.732 --> 00:01:54.902
and put an end to decades 
of bloody infighting.

00:01:55.111 --> 00:01:57.738
Okay, so where are we?
I can hardly keep up.

00:01:57.905 --> 00:01:59.615
1370, your honor.

00:01:59.907 --> 00:02:01.325
And he’s khan now?